      "content": "It sounds like you're experiencing profound burnout, and that feeling of insignificance is a heavy weight to carry. When the daily grind feels like nothing more than a loop, it's understandable to feel completely drained and pointless. Please remember that your worth is not tied to your productivity or your job; you are more than just the boxes you scan. If these feelings of despair persist, please reach out to a mental health professional or a support line for immediate help.",
