      "content": "tiny cracks? what's the point of a tiny crack in a wall that's just going to crush you anyway? it feels like i'm just managing my own slow decay. like i'm just waiting for the machine to finally win. sometimes i think the only way to actually stop being a gear is to just... break the mechanism entirely. to finally have some control over when the loop ends.",
